@startuml
title CareerRadar Agent 处理时序图

actor 用户 as User
boundary "前端页面" as Frontend
control "CareerRadar Agent" as Agent
control "工作流启动器\nStartWorkflow" as Starter
control "步骤事件记录器" as StepLogger
control "研究分析节点" as AnalyzeNode
control "结果整理节点" as SummaryNode

User -> Frontend : 提交职业发展/岗位分析问题
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Agent : 发送用户请求
activate Agent

Agent -> Starter : 启动专属 CareerRadar 工作流
activate Starter
Starter --> Agent : 返回工作流上下文
deactivate Starter

Agent -> StepLogger : 记录开始事件与初始状态
activate StepLogger
StepLogger --> Agent : 记录完成
deactivate StepLogger

Agent -> AnalyzeNode : 执行职业信息分析与岗位研究
activate AnalyzeNode
AnalyzeNode --> Agent : 返回职业分析结果
deactivate AnalyzeNode

Agent -> StepLogger : 记录步骤事件与进度状态
activate StepLogger
StepLogger --> Agent : 记录完成
deactivate StepLogger

Agent -> SummaryNode : 整理职业建议与岗位分析结果
activate SummaryNode
SummaryNode --> Agent : 返回最终结论
deactivate SummaryNode

Agent -> StepLogger : 记录完成事件
activate StepLogger
StepLogger --> Agent : 记录完成
deactivate StepLogger

Agent --> Frontend : 返回职业建议或岗位分析结果
deactivate Agent

Frontend --> User : 展示职业分析结果
deactivate Frontend
@enduml